        <span itemprop="definition">(7.5 g, 0.026 mol) dissolved in 20 g of degassified distilled water was added thereto, in addition, methacrylonitrile (150 g, 2.236 mol) and ammonium persulfate (2.55 g, 0.0112 mol, 0.005 equivalent) were added thereto, and the mixture was agitated at 600 rpm.</span>
